msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8"

msgid "1 lowest .. 10 highest. Draws hardware queues from the same pool as the device rules, so enabling priority rules leaves fewer queues for per-client shaping. Custom rules take precedence over short-packet auto detection."
msgstr "1 最低 .. 10 最高。与设备规则共用同一个硬件队列池，因此启用优先规则会减少可用于按客户端限速的队列。自定义规则优先于小包自动识别。"

msgid "A port can only be used with TCP or UDP. Select a protocol first."
msgstr "端口仅适用于 TCP 或 UDP，请先选择协议。"

msgid "Active queues only"
msgstr "仅显示活跃队列"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "Any"
msgstr "任意"

msgid "Automatic: the top hardware queue of this SoC (15 on the 16-queue MT7981/MT7986, 31 on the 32-queue MT7988). Kept outside the queue pool so short flows never share a queue with a shaped client."
msgstr "自动：使用当前 SoC 的最高一条硬件队列（16 队列的 MT7981/MT7986 为 15，32 队列的 MT7988 为 31）。它位于队列池之外，小包流不会与被限速的客户端共用队列。"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "双向"

msgid "Collecting data..."
msgstr "正在采集数据..."

msgid "Connection limit"
msgstr "连接数限制"

msgid "Conntrack table size"
msgstr "连接跟踪表容量"

msgid "DSCP"
msgstr "DSCP"

msgid "Dest port"
msgstr "目的端口"

msgid "Device rules"
msgstr "设备规则"

msgid "Direction"
msgstr "方向"

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Download queue %s is already used by another rule."
msgstr "下载队列 %s 已被其他规则占用。"

msgid "EQoS Extended"
msgstr "EQoS 扩展版"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Enable Short-packet priority first."
msgstr "请先开启小包优先。"

msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

msgid "Global number of conntrack entries the kernel may hold. 0 keeps the kernel default. This only protects the table itself; the per-device connection limits do the real work."
msgstr "内核可容纳的连接跟踪条目总数。0 表示沿用内核默认值。这里只保护表本身，真正的限制由各设备规则的连接数上限完成。"

msgid "HQoS Settings"
msgstr "HQoS 设置"

msgid "IPv4 address"
msgstr "IPv4 地址"

msgid "IPv6 address"
msgstr "IPv6 地址"

msgid "Hardware queues"
msgstr "硬件队列"

msgid "Len"
msgstr "长度"

msgid "Maximum average packet size (16-128 bytes) treated as a short flow."
msgstr "视为小包流的平均包长上限（16-128 字节）。"

msgid "Maximum number of simultaneous connections this client may hold, counted over the connections it opens in both directions. 0 means unlimited. Once the budget is reached only new connections are refused, running ones are kept. Costs no hardware queue, so it also works when both rates are 0. Needs kmod-nft-connlimit; 300-500 is a sane ceiling for one client, since the FOE table holds 16384 entries per direction and one device must not be able to fill it."
msgstr "该客户端可同时保持的连接数上限，按它发起的连接统计，上下行都计入。0 表示不限制。达到上限后只拒绝新建连接，已有连接保持不断。不占用硬件队列，因此上下行速率都为 0 时同样可用。需要 kmod-nft-connlimit；单设备建议 300-500，因为 FOE 表每个方向只有 16384 条，不能让一台设备占满。"

msgid "Maximum rate in Mbit/s. Use 0 for no limit."
msgstr "最大速率，单位为 Mbit/s；填 0 表示不限制该方向。"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

msgid "Network speed control service for MediaTek HNAT."
msgstr "面向 MediaTek HNAT 的网速控制服务。"

msgid "No data"
msgstr "无数据"

msgid "Only a unique label for this rule, not a hardware queue. Queues are handed out automatically from a shared pool, one per shaped direction: a client limited both ways takes two queues, a client limited one way takes one. On a 16-queue SoC the pool holds 14, so up to 7 clients shaped both ways, or more when some are limited in one direction only. A rule always takes a hardware queue while one is free; once the pool is exhausted only the affected direction falls back to TC software shaping, which keeps it limited but moves that client off hardware acceleration."
msgstr "只是本规则的唯一编号，不再是硬件队列。队列由共享池按需分配，每个限速方向占一条：双向限速的客户端占两条，单向限速的占一条。16 队列的 SoC 上池容量为 14，即最多 7 台双向限速客户端；若部分客户端只限一个方向，可容纳更多。只要池里还有空位，规则一定优先占用硬件队列；池满后仅受影响的那个方向改用 TC 软件限速，限速依然生效，但该客户端会脱离硬件加速。"

msgid "Optional DSCP value 0-63, e.g. 46 for EF."
msgstr "可选 DSCP 值（0-63），如 EF 为 46。"

msgid "Optional, e.g. 443 or 27000-27030."
msgstr "可选，如 443 或 27000-27030。"

msgid "Optional, e.g. 53 or 27000-27030."
msgstr "可选，如 53 或 27000-27030。"

msgid "Packet priority settings"
msgstr "包优先级设置"

msgid "Packets"
msgstr "包数"

msgid "Packets/s"
msgstr "包/秒"

msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

msgid "Priority"
msgstr "优先级"

msgid "Priority queue"
msgstr "优先队列"

msgid "Priority rules"
msgstr "优先级规则"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "QoS"
msgstr "QoS"

msgid "Queue"
msgstr "队列"

msgid "Queue Monitor"
msgstr "队列监控"

msgid "Queue map"
msgstr "队列映射"

msgid "Rate"
msgstr "速率"

msgid "Re-marks the small packets matched by this rule (pure TCP ACKs and packets up to the short-flow bound) into the short-packet priority queue, so ACKs do not queue behind bulk traffic inside this rule's queue. Requires Short-packet priority and a port."
msgstr "把本规则命中的小包（TCP 纯 ACK 及不超过小包长度上限的包）改写入小包优先队列，避免 ACK 在本规则队列里排在大包后面。需先开启小包优先并填写端口。"

msgid "Recognizes short flows (TCP ACK / small UDP) in hardware before offload and puts them into the priority queue below. Tune it with \"Short-flow length\" and \"Priority queue\". Works on any port, including direct 2.5G."
msgstr "在硬件卸载之前识别小包流（TCP ACK / 小 UDP），并把它们送入下方的优先队列。可用“小包长度”和“优先队列”调整。适用于任意端口，包括直连 2.5G。"

msgid "Rule number"
msgstr "规则编号"

msgid "Short-flow length"
msgstr "小包长度阈值"

msgid "Short-packet priority"
msgstr "小包优先"

msgid "Small packets to the short-packet priority queue"
msgstr "小包改走小包优先队列"

msgid "Source port"
msgstr "源端口"

msgid "This value is already in use."
msgstr "该值已被使用。"

msgid "Total download bandwidth."
msgstr "总下载带宽。"

msgid "Total upload bandwidth."
msgstr "总上传带宽。"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "Upload queue %s is already used by another rule."
msgstr "上传队列 %s 已被其他规则占用。"

msgid "The hardware queue pool is full: any further shaped client is limited in software (TC) instead, which keeps it shaped but takes it off hardware acceleration."
msgstr "硬件队列池已满：之后新增的限速客户端会改用软件（TC）限速，限速依然生效，但会脱离硬件加速。"

msgid "unlimited"
msgstr "不限"

msgid "unspecified"
msgstr "未指定"

msgid "Queue group"
msgstr "队列组"

msgid "Optional. Clients naming the same group share one hardware queue, so the rates below become that group's total budget instead of a per-client limit. Leave empty to give this client its own queue, exactly as before. Every member of a group must use the same rate in each shaped direction. A group costs two queues when shaped both ways and one when shaped in a single direction, so a 16-queue SoC holds up to 7 bidirectional groups or 15 single-direction groups -- each with any number of clients inside it. Members of one group share a single FIFO shaper: one of them can consume the whole group budget while the others wait, which is the price of putting more clients on the hardware path than there are queues."
msgstr "可选。填写相同组名的客户端共用一个硬件队列，此时上面的速率变成该组的总带宽，而不再是每台设备的独立配额。留空表示这台设备独占一条队列，行为与之前完全相同。同一组在每个限速方向上必须使用相同的速率。双向限速的组占两条队列，只限单向的组占一条，所以 16 队列的 SoC 最多容纳 7 个双向组或 15 个单向组，组内客户端数量不限。同组成员共用一个 FIFO 整形器：其中一台可以吃满整组带宽，其余成员只能排队——这是在硬件路径上承载比队列数更多的客户端所必须付出的代价。"

msgid "standalone"
msgstr "独立"

msgid "Use up to 32 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores."
msgstr "最多 32 个字符，只能用字母、数字、点、横线和下划线。"

